      "msgid": "S27_UDES_16_LS_BOT_descr",
      "msgid_plural": null,
      "msgstr": "Further development of the UDES 14E2 project was proposed by the Hägglunds company. The vehicle was to have a lowered silhouette and be equipped with a 105 mm autoloader gun. In 1974, the project was merged with the Bofors project, which resulted in the UDES 15/16 project. No prototypes were built.",
      "msgstr_plural": null
